// Windows resource script for the executable file icon, compiled by
// `../../build.rs` with the Windows SDK resource compiler (`rc.exe`).
//
// The path is relative to this file: this is the executable's file icon
// (Explorer/Start menu/shortcuts/pinning), not the runtime window icon, which
// `src/main.rs` loads from 128x128.png. Resource id 1 is the conventional id for
// an application's main icon.
1 ICON "icon.ico"
